+/* sys_mempool_* (sysPrxForUser): a pool of fixed-size blocks carved from a chunk
+ * the title supplies. Behaviour as RPCS3's sys_mempool.cpp: ids start at 1, the
+ * free list starts as every block in address order and is used as a stack
